WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Gender and sex are different

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.600
and one doesn't mean the other

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.860
like me having a penis doesn't make me a man or does not make me less of a woman

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:09.360
music

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:45.040
I was six years old and have a clear vivid memory

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.420
of telling a friend walking down the street

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.800
I think I would've been better off born a girl

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.240
and I had my whole family - half my family telling me, you can't be that

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.160
my friends telling me you'll never be a female

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.840
and a therapist telling me you'll never look female.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:00.680
You're hands are too big, your voice is too low

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:02.520
and here I am, very female

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:06.260
so I'd like to believe I was right

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.220
I know when I was 7 I knew

